      "removedKwicHead": "淺交涉。然雖如是，只如興化於大覺脫下衲衣，痛與一",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Chaozong Tongren"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d055e572dc64",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a6",
      "removedKwicHead": "却回舉似師。師曰。汝更去問。待他有答。汝便噓兩聲",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d055e572dc64",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 2,
      "mergedLabel": "a7",
      "removedKwicHead": "其僧到雪峯。一依前語祇對。峯曰。也須是趙州始得。",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d055e572dc64",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 3,
      "mergedLabel": "a8",
      "removedKwicHead": "見性唯祇自心。認著依前不是。塵中世界無涯。",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Fenyang Shanzhao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d055e572dc64",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 4,
      "mergedLabel": "a9",
      "removedKwicHead": "眨眼滲漏，開口蹉過，計較不成，依前懡㦬。拘那含牟",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Zhenxie Qingliao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d055e572dc64",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 5,
      "mergedLabel": "a10",
      "removedKwicHead": "喚爾作菩薩便歡喜。喚爾作賊漢便惡發。依前只是舊時",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Dahui Zonggao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d076804616d6",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a5",
      "removedKwicHead": "嵩山安國師處來。祖曰：什麼物與麼來？師八年後，一",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Nanyue Huairang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d076804616d6",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 2,
      "mergedLabel": "a6",
      "removedKwicHead": "答云：「說似一物即不中。」祖云：「還假修證也無？",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Huineng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d076804616d6",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 3,
      "mergedLabel": "a7",
      "removedKwicHead": "祖問讓和尚。甚麼處來嵩山安和尚處來。祖云。甚麼物",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Huineng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d076804616d6",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 4,
      "mergedLabel": "a8",
      "removedKwicHead": "山會上有多端，立雪庭前無二致。甚麼物幾多般，見未",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Wuyi Yuanlai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d0e5e6e5d1ee",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a4",
      "removedKwicHead": "盡眾生界空，無有眾生名字，我乃發菩提心。薦福，懷",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Tianyi Yihuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d0e5e6e5d1ee",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 2,
      "mergedLabel": "a5",
      "removedKwicHead": "悟，作禮曰：某已脫野狐身，住在山後，敢乞依亡僧津",
      "removedClaimText": "下得一轉語",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Baizhang Huaihai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_d0e5e6e5d1ee",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 3,
      "mergedLabel": "a6",
      "removedKwicHead": "云某甲於過去迦葉佛時曾住此山有學人問大脩行底人還",
      "removedClaimText": "",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_eeb3c71567a1",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a7",
      "removedKwicHead": "浮渡之鎮，而瀋邸不復南面朝釋子矣。師於紫柏老人後",
      "removedClaimText": "歷五十暮而符其月日，僧臘以十計者四焉",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_eeb3c71567a1",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 2,
      "mergedLabel": "a8",
      "removedKwicHead": "於一簣者，幾希矣。由甲寅以迄辛酉，兵戈頻仍。師處",
      "removedClaimText": "享年七十三歲，僧臘五十三",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_fe8d4efe588f",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a4",
      "removedKwicHead": "見秖教汝不作佛見不落佛邊不作眾生見不落眾生𨓉不作",
      "removedClaimText": "見處",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Huangbo Xiyun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_ff59d753a7b1",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a4",
      "removedKwicHead": "如是則乃可逍遙山谷。放曠郊𮠔。遊逸形儀。",
      "removedClaimText": "逍遙",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Yongjia Xuanjue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_ff59d753a7b1",
      "si": 2,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a2",
      "removedKwicHead": "逍遙和尚逍遙和尚。一日師在禪床上坐。",
      "removedClaimText": "逍遙",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_ff59d753a7b1",
      "si": 3,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a2",
      "removedKwicHead": "江西逍遙山懷忠禪師江西逍遙山懷忠禪師。",
      "removedClaimText": "逍遙",
      "coveredBy": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_ff7bd0937cb0",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a4",
      "removedKwicHead": "云當時入門便棒又作麼生師云莫謗他好進云秪如後代兒",
      "removedClaimText": "有功者賞",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Yulin Tongxiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "class": "anchor-remove-dup",
      "entry": "t_ff91d085da8d",
      "si": 1,
      "aidx": 1,
      "mergedLabel": "a4",
      "removedKwicHead": "問依經觧義三世佛冤離經一字如同魔說時如何師云固守",
      "removedClaimText": "道得",
      "coveredBy": [
        "Baizhang Huaihai"
      ]
    }
  ],
